            are translations of invertible sheaves, by step 1.
          %p
            %strong Step 3.
            Now we establish a bijection between the sets of points of the varieties.
          %p
            Since
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi 𝒪
